  {
   "id": "U1",
   "text": "The size adjustment: the Act requires the Energy Office to adjust the index for dwelling size, no rule has been made.",
   "readings": [
    "U1-a: no adjustment beyond the per-square-foot measure",
    "U1-b: for homes above 2,500 square feet the maximum applies to the home's total modeled energy as if it were 2,500 square feet"
   ],
